e Civil War."}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:5oxmmejbvv3tieufrfrdurjs/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxytutanlk2b", "author_did": "did:plc:5oxmmejbvv3tieufrfrdurjs", "handle": "alexwilcock.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-16T15:02:49.638Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-16T15:02:57.656Z", "text": "The Civil Wars were a bloody clash of beliefs\nI know which side I would have to be on, though they definitely wouldn\u2019t be on mine.\nWhile Cavaliers vs Roundheads split sort of Liberal vs Democrat, British politics\u2019 aftermath was neater: the Whigs took up both (and Tories took to divine right)."}]}, {"team": "cle", "query": "Cavaliers", "hour": "2026-10-16T16:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:kb3hyaukx4ftswfluaprmkqd/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxyxfz5du22u", "author_did": "did:plc:kb3hyaukx4ftswfluaprmkqd", "handle": "pharaohstransport.bsky.social", "created_at": "2026-10-16T16:06:14.025Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-16T16:06:14.163Z", "text": "Bulls vs. Cavaliers at United Center Dec. 3! Ride from Milwaukee to Chicago and back with a private chauffeur. Milwaukee to O\u2019Hare is a sister company owned and operated by Pharaoh\u2019s Transportation.\n\n#Bulls #MilwaukeeToChicago\nmilwaukeetoohare.com/routes/milwa..."}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:dk47d4q3hxmvrteh3elo5fuh/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxyxawyvci2o", "author_did": "did:plc:dk47d4q3hxmvrteh3elo5fuh", "handle": "icdb.tv", "created_at": "2026-10-16T16:03:23.760Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-16T16:03:24.061Z", "text": "ESPN Unlimited / The CW bring the Virginia Cavaliers vs SMU FBS match, with Thom Brennaman and Jason Cabinda #SMU #Virginia Cavaliers"}]}, {"team": "cle", "query": "Cavaliers", "hour": "2026-10-16T17:00:00+00:00", "status": "ok", "posts": [{"uri": "at://did:plc:brlra5qviwsbansrgtrtcnn6/app.bsky.feed.post/3mxz3ryepcc24", "author_did": "did:plc:brlra5qviwsbansrgtrtcnn6", "handle": "media-news.at.thenote.app", "created_at": "2026-10-16T17:24:30.775Z", "indexed_at": "2026-10-16T17:24:31.861Z", "text": "Cleveland Ca